# Wave W17-M (Route 107): swell sand — swell-shore sand flecks, wet and nearly awash, the emptiest lane’s shore showing only where the swell lets it (design: open water, honest weather). Route 107’s own shore — darker and wetter than every other lane’s sand, foam-flecked through.
